":"Respiratory therapists and providers prescribing oxygen would see new coverage and payment structures under Medicare."},{"industry":"insurance","confidence":0.6,"rationale":"Medicare payment changes for oxygen services could affect supplemental insurance coverage and coordination of benefits."}],"plainSummary":"This bill changes how Medicare pays for supplemental oxygen equipment and services. Instead of using a competitive bidding system, it would establish separate payments that adjust for inflation. It would also formally cover services provided by respiratory therapists, require a standardized electronic prescription form, and give patients specific rights such as choosing their own oxygen supplier.","classificationMethod":"llm","plain":{"whoItTouches":"Anyone who sees a doctor or pays for care.","confidence":"crs-summary"},"topOverlap":{"bioguideId":"M001210","score":0.06769432815073852},"overlapCount":63},"meaning":{"percentile":21.59646631960877,"median":0.01073720309570498,"n":6339,"ordinary":[],"unattributedShare":0.8518840943492924}},{"billId":"119-hr-4721","bioguideId":"G000600","cycle":2026,"score":0.0029944142744805185,"matches":[{"industry":"construction","donorAmount":17500,"donorShare":0.004701972827696682,"billConfidence":0.65,"contribution":0.0016085696515804437},{"industry":"agriculture","donorAmount":24500,"donorShare":0.006582761958775355,"billConfidence":0.4,"contribution":0.0013858446229000748}],"method":{"formula":"score = Σ_industries ( donorShare(industry) × billWeight(industry) ), where billWeight = classifierConfidence / Σ classifierConfidence. Range 0–1, read as a weighted share of disclosed itemized money.","donorProfileCycle":2026,"billClassificationMethod":"llm","unclassifiedDonorShare":0.8518840943492924},"bill":{"id":"119-hr-4721","congress":119,"billType":"hr","billNumber":"4721","title":"Healthy H2O Act","introducedDate":"2025-07-23","latestActionDate":"2025-07-23","latestActionText":"Referred to the House Committee on Agricult